    "Native consumption rolls back: direct replay after savepoint rollback succeeds; only the composed host restriction prevents resubmission",
    "READ COMMITTED only; writer rejects other isolation levels",
    "Raw fixed typed fact homes and captured normalized read-rule lowerer only; no admitted owner artifact, production subject mapping or complete authority mutation closure",
